// would rebuild the tab markup from scratch and fall back to hardcoding the
// first tab active, discarding whatever tab the user had clicked to. Both
// mutables are shared across all 3 Roadway Class panes, mirroring how a
// single vmtActiveTab already applies to all of them.
mutable vmtActiveTab = "All Roadways"
